msgstr "⟪k:0⟫啊、⟪k:1⟫啊……⟪k:2⟫啊、⟪k:3⟫啊——"

#: scenario2:scenario2_5047375F_6829_4571_9592_565849D8DDA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 247bb291d23a0ef176b8eeb1c952db8d49f3572eaf8a0367a10d4f8e102f4317
#. default-sha256: ffb0f8ef5ca7e6ff9fe8f821481290997c1da8af84c86999d1df0b86ae64a751
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5047375F_6829_4571_9592_565849D8DDA9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Will they attack me again? ⟪k:1⟫No, if I ask—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Did they look like they were "
"open to requests?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（又要袭击我吗？⟪k:1⟫不，⟪k:2⟫只要恳求的话⟪k:3⟫……只要恳求的话就有希望？ ）"

#: scenario2:scenario2_423F6A9D_812A_4591_BA40_D5F00A1C0966
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17f436639a1676f3ed2974756f711c6f8dd2aff0ba381ce67aee1f858db4f764
#. default-sha256: 5fcfcc706da500f2bccecafb8ee17e8de31fe3e78e3613c1995c54b660e7443c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_423F6A9D_812A_4591_BA40_D5F00A1C0966"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(No, they tried to kill me. ⟪k:1⟫They almost killed me.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫They threw stones at me. "
"⟪k:4⟫They did more than that.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫（不对。⟪k:1⟫他们会来杀我的，⟪k:2⟫我差点被杀了。⟪k:3⟫他们往我身上扔石头。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫不止如"
"此……）"

#: scenario2:scenario2_8511A9B8_2BE7_4A63_B210_C4B29BEDEA5E
