msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Hoes and knives and sticks and I don’t know,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫things I didn’t even recognize. ⟪k:3⟫"
"They hit me with them.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（他们还用铁锹、⟪k:1⟫菜刀、⟪k:2⟫木棒，⟪k:3⟫还有许多叫不出名字的东西来殴打我）"

