"⟪k:0⟫(I’m so thirsty... ⟪k:1⟫Water... ⟪k:2⟫I just need water...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Will they not even give "
"me any water?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（好痛苦……⟪k:1⟫水……⟪k:2⟫至少给我水……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫甚至连水都不给我吗……）"

