"⟪k:0⟫(I’m... ⟪k:1⟫thirsty. ⟪k:2⟫My stomach is probably empty too...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I don’t know "
"anymore, ⟪k:5⟫but I’m hungry. ⟪k:6⟫So very hungry...)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫（我……⟪k:1⟫喉咙很渴。⟪k:2⟫大概，⟪k:3⟫肚子也很饿……⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫已经搞不清楚了。⟪k:6⟫但是仍然饥肠"
"辘辘……）"

