"⟪k:0⟫(A well... ⟪k:1⟫A well. ⟪k:2⟫I can find a well. ⟪k:3⟫There has to be a well. ⟪k:4⟫I know "
"what that is. ⟪k:5⟫I know what a well is.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（井……⟪k:1⟫井……⟪k:2⟫要寻找井，⟪k:3⟫应该有的，⟪k:4⟫我知道……⟪k:5⟫井在哪里）"

