msgid "⟪k:0⟫(What else do I know?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（还知道其他事吗……？）"

#: scenario2:scenario2_8082F61E_9F61_4090_9231_7EF71CE9293F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de94210db9842cb06313d01ce1c19f9a2b40d5a1636a16f99fb10f2d7357fdec
